usei uma view sql direto no banco para retonar os nomes dos gerentes usando 
SELECT 
    e.Ssn AS Employee_SSN,
    CONCAT(e.Fname, ' ', e.Lname) AS Employee_Name,
    e.Salary AS Employee_Salary,
    e.Dno AS Department_Number,
    CONCAT(m.Fname, ' ', m.Lname) AS Manager_Name
FROM azure_company.employee e
LEFT JOIN azure_company.employee m 
    ON e.Super_ssn = m.Ssn;

